    text: "The dragon breathes in the herbs, the essence, the iron \u2014 and OPENS
      ITS EYES. \"I dreamed a thousand years, and you woke me with patience, not
      swords. Cultivate on, little one. I will watch over these grounds.\" \U0001F432
      THE DRAGON IS AWAKE."
